<title>CANADA: CWB ups June 97/98 durum PRO, wheat, barley steady.</title>
<headline>CWB ups June 97/98 durum PRO, wheat, barley steady.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Wheat Board said Thursday it had raised by C$15 a tonne its 1997/98 (Aug/July) Pool Return Outlook (PRO) for durum wheat and left wheat and barley PROs unchanged.</p>
<p>CWB's June forecast for the durum PRO was increased by C$15 a tonne because global supplies were expected to remain tight through much of 1997/98 while demand remains steady.</p>
</text>
